-- title:
--   True stopped sample-path discounted Taylor marked jump residual integrable and centred at ruin-clipped clock
-- statement:
--   Under the original spectrally negative Levy risk process, genuine admissible dividend path and local C2 spatial value function assumptions, the stopped discounted signed compensated nonlinear Taylor jump integral is integrable and mean zero when the jump random measure is constructed directly from jumps of the physically stopped original Levy sample path at the clock sigma. Full negative Levy jump activity is permitted and the kernel includes original pre-dividend left limits, discount, spatial interval and the pre-ruin mask. All mark integrability and compensation hypotheses are supplied by the earlier Proved original Ito jumps13 source theorem and the exact stopped original NX integral transport, without assuming additional abstract L1 integrability for the source kernel.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/selpoG/lean-ftap-closedness/blob/8c9c46e1b6e455f7d3069062957d4363879836ce/FTAPTheorem42/Foundations/Paths.lean

